5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know how this affects our daily flow! I'll look into the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and the arrival times in the badge records.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll check the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'll look into the drawn plan against the staff survey and what this year's two joiners reported.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll take the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'll check the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year and the two project strands within earshot last spring!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Does anyone else think we should check the joiners' reports? Mizuki is already on it, but I wonder if they noticed anything about the morning rush too.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"The joiners' reports are likely more about integration than timing. Rin, your focus on the morning routine should cover the logistics of the start of the day.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Toshio. I'll focus on how the new joiners adapted to the team culture and the physical layout, which should give us a different perspective than the timing data.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I'm more interested in the physical environment. If we're moving, we should ensure the noise levels and ergonomics are actually addressed this time.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I think Shion is right about the environment, but I'm also worried about how we actually talk to each other! I'll stick with the project strands and the shuffle history to see how we've handled changes.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm just worried that if we don't know when everyone arrives, we might pick a system that's totally unfair! I'll stick with my choices.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Fair enough. I believe the financial constraints will be the most objective guide for us, so I will remain focused on the billing and the quotes.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll keep my focus on the survey and the joiners' reports to ensure we aren't ignoring the human element of the layout.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I'll stick with the sound readings and the physio's notes. If we ignore the physical toll of the workspace, the most ""objective"" plan will still be a failure.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'll stay with my picks too! I really want to see if sitting closer actually helps us work better together.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I guess we're all set then! Let's get the information and see what we find.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. Let's proceed with these investigations and reconvene once we have the data.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I'll make sure to look for any patterns in the survey that might conflict with the new layout.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,I'll be looking for the hard data on comfort and noise. See you all soon.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I can't wait to see what the data says! Let's hope we find a way to make everyone happy.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
